      "message": "Speculative fix:\n1. Comment at https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/vulkan/PipelineCacheVk.h;l\u003d63;drc\u003dc35a0a84da3d530e04553731043b35b5e1ccc563 suggest only one thread should be inside SerializeToBlobImpl. But multi thread could get in via `ComputePipeline::InitImpl` -\u003e `DidCompilePipeline` -\u003e `Flush` -\u003e `SerializeToBlobImpl`. Add a mutex\n2. The crash backtrace found by gregg is SIGABRT inside EqualityFunc::operator of WeakRef accessing. `WeakRef::Promote` could return nullptr. Do a nullptr check first for aRef and bRef.",
      "revId": "f6fd62344529463dd382e9860f036eb95408fc93",
